      "title": "Update display filter bookmark examples",
      "message": "Update display filter bookmark examples\n\nWrite inequalities more clearly and naturally. Remove obsolete\nadmonition.\n\nRewrite DNS examples to be more pedagogical to avoid conflating\nports with protocols.\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
